                            <p class="P2_inner">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;One (1) rail-mounted fiber termination module with twelve (12) position splice holder, six (6) front/end-mounted duplex LC/UPC adapters, and twelve (12) fiber pigtail at least three (3) feet long with factory-installed LC/UPC connectors: Multilink FTM-12-LC/UPC-S1 or approved equal.</p>

